# SHARED between two Vercel projects that both deploy from this repo root:
# the web app (Root Directory apps/web) and the engine (Root Directory .).
# Anything excluded here disappears from BOTH uploads -- excluding apps/ here
# made the web app's deploy fail with "Root Directory apps/web does not exist".
# Per-project exclusions belong in vercel.json's excludeFiles instead.
#
# uv.lock is the one thing that must be excluded globally: it is gitignored,
# but `vercel deploy` uploads local files, and its presence makes the Python
# builder switch to uv and install dependencies WITHOUT the project itself --
# every engine route then 500s with ModuleNotFoundError.
uv.lock
